member.summary:
Walks or runs to the thing and uses it (HumanAIContent_ActivateRunCB): a switch pressed within the last second is left;
at the node it turns to the thing and presses (holding the press through the switch state) unless it is the squad's gun, then
tells the others the thing is used, and, for the gun, mans it.

Moves to a node (HumanAI_MoveCharacterToNode): at it already it has arrived; on the way there it keeps walking its path;
otherwise a new path is searched from where it stands (between its legal nodes, from the nearer) and its first step taken. A
node no path reaches kills the soldier, as the original does.

Whether its rounds go through a material seen in the way (the line-of-fire test of HumanAI_RunDetection): a gun whose
round is a bullet does when its penetration is at least the material's; a rocket or anything else a gun fires does not;
what is no gun leaves sight alone.

remarks.para:
The host moves its placed models' collision as they move (Project I.G.I.'s );
 copies each placement's pose as it stands onto its solid, once a tick, so I.G.I. 2's rounds, sight and
feet meet the model where it is.

member.remarks:
DefineComputerObjective_RunHandler: while its Objectives Valid expression does not hold it becomes the set aside;
otherwise it is the set in force and each objective's complete and failed flags are its expressions' values, truncated to a
byte; an objective with no expression is neither.

remarks.para:
AnimQTask_UpdateInternalDataHandler, as the level loads: the channels cleared, the tick nought, a step taken, so the target is
set back to its start. AnimQTask_RunHandler: its run expression, chopped to a byte, where it has one, says whether it runs;
running, it is taken to the tick after the one it is at (AnimQTask_SetIdealTime).

member.summary:
A footstep: on the ground, alive, the next sound of the step order. In water, a splash and a wade as loud as the water is deep;
on land the ground material's walking or running sound, quieter by half crouched. The player turning on the spot, standing
or crouched, makes none.

remarks.para:
A bullet adds its damage and, enough of it, explodes it the next tick (ExplodeObject_WeaponHitHandler, 0x49CCE0);
a blast adds what reaches it and, enough, sets it off after its delay (ExplodeObject_ExplosionHitHandler,
0x49CD80). An object whose damage scale is less than nothing takes no damage.

A weapon picked by number is taken if it may be selected, and the cycle moves to its place. Otherwise the cycle
steps forwards on the next-weapon key, when forced or when it has no place, and back on the previous-weapon key;
from the weapon shown, it wraps and takes the first weapon that may be selected, trying each entry once.

member.summary:
How well detectors see the player, humanplayer.c HumanPlayer_UpdateVisibilityFactor: fully while a shot has lit it;
otherwise half the light it stands in, to the task's visibility gamma; less crouched (four fifths) or lying (three fifths);
more while turning on the spot or crawling (by a twentieth), walking (a tenth) or running (three twentieths); and kept
between the task's minimum and maximum.

HumanPlayer_RunStateSwim (igi2 0x4AB860): a stroke sounds when one starts; the body is kept at swimming depth;
forward or back strokes along the body; out of the water and on the ground it stands; dead it dies; the strokes turn from
one way to the other, and with no key held it treads water.

member.remarks:
Getting on: onto the wire at the player's place along it, three quarters of a metre clear of either end, facing along it away
from its middle, stopped and locked to it with the collision off, for the camera's third mode. On it: a fresh press of activate,
coming within three quarters of a metre of an end, or death lets go, and the player falls.

member.returns:
Detected while a soldier has the player in plain sight and has confirmed him; an alarm while a soldier is alarmed;
suspicious while one is still making out a figure he sees; searching while one who has seen him, or heard him shoot,
keeps him in his list without sight of him; otherwise none.

member.remarks:
A compiled script reaches a native through , which hands it a ;
script text evaluated as an expression () has no such context to give. Registering a native
here does both, so one body serves both callers as it does in the original.

member.summary:
Killed silently, HumanSoldier_InitStateSilentKill (igi2 0x4E9610): its row at once, damage at the limit, heading
fixed, the upper body unturned, moving by the clip; dead and settled with no blood; the trigger let go and the weapons dropped;
seen by detection; the upper body kept off.

Where an attachment stands in the world, ModelObj_UpdateAttachment (igi2 0x56CB40) for one on a bone: its relative
position turned by the bone's rows plus the bone's position, turned by the parent's rows and added to the parent's position;
its orientation the parent's times the bone's times its relative one, each sum in the routine's order at 24 bits.

remarks.para:
BirdFlock_EnterHandler, each frame: within its cutoff distance of the camera it is seen, and each bird is drawn as four
triangles, wings a metre to either side of a body 0.4 m long, its wing tips flapping 0.8 m fifteen times a period of its second swing;
beyond, it is not seen and stands still.

Gamma's and alpha's sine and cosine are used straight off fsin and fcos; beta's are first stored
as floats. Precision control does not reach the trigonometric instructions, so their own results are wide;
this port has them at double precision, against the FPU's 64-bit significand.

Above a dot product of 0.99999 it blends straight, and below its negative straight toward the opposite of the end;
neither is renormalised. Between, the angle is the polynomial arc cosine of the dot's magnitude, and the start's weight is
negated when the dot is below nought.
